# ---------- Camp Taurajo ----------
A 893 | Tatternack Steelforge, at the forge in Camp Taurajo
A 879 | Mangletooth, the quilboar in the cage
A 1130 @ The Barrens, 44.9, 59.1 | Jorn Skyseer, in Camp Taurajo. Keep it in your log for Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff (a later segment; his next quest is level 30)
A 884 @ The Barrens, 47.0, 61.0 | Optional: Owatanka, a named thunderhawk, flies around Camp Taurajo. Its Tailspike starts this quest. Skip if you don't see it
A 883 @ The Barrens, 47.2, 51.6 | Optional: Lakota'mani, a named grey kodo, wanders just north of Camp Taurajo. Its Hoof starts this quest. Skip if you don't see it

# ---------- Field of Giants, Bael Modan ----------
C 868 | Field of Giants south of Camp Taurajo: loot Silithid Eggs from the mounds and kill the silithid around them (they drop eggs too). Ghost Wolf between the mounds
A 98093 @ The Barrens, 47.9, 77.6 | Sulhasa is stuck up a tree beside the road south of the silithid field, with lizards and hyenas all around her
A 885 @ The Barrens, 44.8, 78.9 | Optional: Washte Pawne, a named wind serpent, flies over the fields here. Its Feather starts this quest. Skip if you don't see it
A 843 | Gann Stonespire, at his camp north of Bael Modan
C 843 | Bael Modan dig site to the south: kill Bael'dun Excavators and Foremen. Prospector Khazgorm in the pit drops the journal. Kill Stormhide and Hecklefang Stalkers for Field to Clear on every trip
T 843
A 846
A 857 | Feegly the Exiled, at the east edge of Bael Modan
C 846,857 | Bael'dun Keep: soldiers, riflemen and officers drop the Nitroglycerin, Wood Pulp and Sodium Nitrate. The Tear of the Moons is in General Twinbraid's Strongbox inside the keep (49.1,84.2). General Twinbraid (level 30, five levels above you) stands right beside it and hits hard: clear the soldiers around him first, then pull him at full health and mana with Stoneclaw Totem down, Earth Shock and Healing Wave when low. If your shocks keep missing or he takes half your health in a few hits, drop Earthbind Totem and run, then abandon The Tear of the Moons and skip its turn-in. Loot the box once he is dead
T 857 | Feegly. Skip this if you abandoned The Tear of the Moons
T 846 | Back north to Gann
A 849 | Keep the Explosive Stick of Gann: you blow up the flying machine after Blackthorn Ridge

# ---------- Brine, Blackthorn Ridge and the flying machine ----------
T 1534 | Brine, at her hut a short run west of Gann. Hand in the filled Blue Waterskin
A 220 | Keep the Vial of Purest Water for Islen Waterseer south of Ratchet (end of this segment)
C 893,879 | Blackthorn Ridge, south-west of Gann: Razormane Pathfinders/Stalkers drop the Backstabber, Seers the Wand, Warfrenzy the Shield. Kuz is at 45,80, Nak at 44,83, Lok Orcbane at 40,80. Earth Shock the Seers' casts
C 849 | From Nak's camp ride east into the dig site and click the Bael Modan Flying Machine (47.0,85.6) to blow it up
T 849 | Back north to Gann
C 98093 | Finish the 7 Stormhide and 7 Hecklefang Stalkers if you still need them
T 98093 @ The Barrens, 47.9, 77.6 | Sulhasa, in her tree a short run east of Gann

