# ---------- Thunder Bluff ----------
FLY Thunder Bluff | A short direct flight from Camp Taurajo
T 1195 | Zangen Stonehoof, on the central mesa of Thunder Bluff
A 1196 | Keep the Filled Etched Phial for Rau Cliffrunner at Freewind Post
T 97538 @ Thunder Bluff, 53.9, 47.3 | Tah Winterhoof, a few steps from Zangen on the same central rise. Hand in the 30 Mirkweed Pods
T 1086 | Apothecary Zamah, in the Pools of Vision under Spirit Rise
TRAIN @ Thunder Bluff, 22.8, 21.1 | The shaman trainers stand in the Pools of Vision right next to Zamah: learn your level 24 and 26 spells (Lightning Bolt rank 5 at 26). Leave Melor Sends Word in your log
H Camp Taurajo | Your hearthstone is still set to Camp Taurajo. If it is on cooldown, fly there instead

# ---------- Into Thousand Needles ----------
N Ride south in Ghost Wolf down the road past Bael Modan to the Great Lift, where the road ends at the south edge of the Barrens, and ride it down into Thousand Needles
T 5881 | Grish Longrunner, at the bottom of the lift
A 4542 | Brave Moonhorn, next to him
T 4542 | Follow the road south-east to Freewind Post, on top of the mesas. Cliffwatcher Longhorn
A 4841
A 5147 | Wanted poster next to Cliffwatcher Longhorn
A 4821 | Hagar Lightninghoof
A 4767 | Elu
T 1196 | Rau Cliffrunner
A 1197
F Freewind Post | Nyse, the wind rider master
S Freewind Post | Innkeeper Abeqwa. You hearth back here from Screeching Canyon at the end of the Needles
A 1149 | Dorn Plainstalker, on the mesa north-east of Freewind Post
C 1149 @ Thousand Needles, 53.9, 41.6 | Walk off the end of the plank beside Dorn. You are caught before you land
T 1149 | Skip the next test (Test of Endurance, elite)

# ---------- Splithoof Crag loop ----------
C 4841 | Galak centaurs on the canyon floor north of Freewind. They often come in pairs: drop Stoneclaw Totem for the second one and heal between pulls
A 4881 @ Thousand Needles, 39.4, 33.1 | Optional: the Galak Messenger walks the road near Splithoof Crag. His Assassination Note starts this quest. Don't hunt long for him
C 1197 | Splithoof Hold (42,31.5): use the phial on the Ancient Brazier, then loot the Cloven Hoof from it. Clear the guards around it first
C 4821 | The Alien Egg sits in a cloud serpent den on the canyon floor around Freewind. It spawns at one of three spots (east around 56,50, south-east around 52,55 or south-west around 38,56). Cloud serpents (26-29) guard it: pull them off one at a time with Stoneclaw Totem down, then loot the egg
T 1197
T 4841
A 5064
T 4821
A 4865 | Hagar's follow-up: report to Motega Firemane at Whitereach Post in the far west. Jandia's two harpy quests in Freewind Post need level 27: you take them after Darkcloud Pinnacle

# ---------- Highperch, Whitereach Post ----------
C 4767 | Highperch, at the far west end of Thousand Needles (leave the Screeching Canyon harpies for later): loot Highperch Wyvern Eggs from the nests. The wyverns (28-29) attack in pairs, so put Stoneclaw Totem down before you loot
C 1153 @ Thousand Needles, 12.2, 18.0 | Gravelsnout Diggers and Surveyors (kobolds) dig in the canyon north of Highperch (around 12,14-22); they drop the Unrefined Ore Sample. They are 28-30: pull one at a time. A few more wander east of Freewind (around 64,48)
A 4770 | Pao'ka Swiftmountain, at Highperch
C 4770 @ Thousand Needles, 17.9, 40.6 | Escort Pao'ka to Whitereach Post. You get attacked on the way: Stoneclaw Totem down, and heal Pao'ka too if he gets low. Redo it if he dies
T 4770 | Motega Firemane, Whitereach Post
T 4865
A 5062
T 4881 | Only if you found the Galak Messenger. Kanati Greycloud
A 4966 | Only if you did Assassination Plot (4881). Otherwise skip this and the next two steps
C 4966 @ Thousand Needles, 21.2, 32.1 | Only if you did Assassination Plot (4881). Centaurs attack Kanati: Stoneclaw Totem, kill them one at a time. Redo it if he dies
T 4966 | Only if you did Assassination Plot (4881)

# ---------- Darkcloud Pinnacle ----------
C 5062 | Incendia Agave plants grow along the canyon east of Whitereach, at the foot of Darkcloud Pinnacle
C 5064 | Darkcloud Pinnacle: the three Secret Notes are in Document Chests in the Grimtotem camps around its base (about 32,33 / 34,40 / 39,41.5)
C 5147 | Arnak Grimtotem (level 29) is at the top of Darkcloud Pinnacle: pull him at full health and mana with Stoneclaw Totem down
A 4904 | Lakota Windsong, at the top of the pinnacle next to Arnak
C 4904 @ Thousand Needles, 38.0, 26.4 | Escort Lakota down toward Freewind Post. Grimtotem ambush on the way: Stoneclaw Totem, Earth Shock the casters. Redo it if she dies
T 4904 | Ride back south-east to Freewind Post. Thalia Amberhide
T 5064
T 5147
T 4767 | Keep Sacred Fire (5062) for Magatha in Thunder Bluff later

# ---------- Screeching Canyon ----------
A 98069 @ Thousand Needles, 46.1, 51.4 | Jandia, the trade supplies vendor in Freewind Post (needs level 27)
A 98070 @ Thousand Needles, 46.1, 51.4 | Also from Jandia (needs level 27)
C 98070,98069 | Screeching Canyon west of Freewind: kill Screeching Harpies, Roguefeathers and Windcallers (28-30). The Stolen Freewind Supplies lie at the foot of the cliff and in the cave at the top. Pull one at a time and Earth Shock the Windcallers' casts
H Freewind Post | If your hearthstone is still on cooldown, ride back east to Freewind Post
