T 220 | Islen Waterseer, in the fishing hut on the shore a short run south of Ratchet. She gives you a Water Sapta: keep it in your bags and do NOT drink it yet. You drink it at the Brazier of Everfount next segment, and only Islen can make you a new one
A 63 | She also hands you the Remaining Drops of Purest Water. Keep the quest, the drops and the sapta for the Brazier of Everfount in Silverpine Forest (next segment)
A 873 | Mahren Skyseer, in the same hut
C 873 | Isha Awak is a big threshadon (level 27) swimming off this coast to the south, around 63,54. Pull it into the shallows so you fight standing, not swimming, and Healing Wave yourself when you drop low
T 873
FLY The Crossroads | Ride back up the shore to the Ratchet flight master
T 906 | Thork
T 868 | Korran. His next quest, The Swarm Grows, needs level 29: you take it in a later segment
